+#    kept tail (``SessionCompaction.select``: ``tail_turns`` default 2, budget
+#    ``preserve_recent_tokens``) and ``r5`` starts with one of
+#    ``_OPENCODE_COMPACTION_INSTRUCTION_PREFIXES`` followed by the summary
