+#    prefixed by a media notice only on media-overflow compactions. ``tail``
+#    (the kept recent messages) may start mid-turn at an assistant message.
+#    (If opencode instead replays a real earlier user message — only when one
+#    exists before the compaction point — no continue message is added; we do
+#    not bind that shape: a single-task agent run never produces it.)
